  "invalidationRule": "Use CHANGE-PROTOCOL dependency kinds/field paths. Semantic accepted publication atomically advances the authoritative invalidation generation. A view-only change does not invalidate evidence. Projection lag is visible; protected effects revalidate current identity/policy/context/cell epoch.",
  "migrationRecovery": "Expand/read-compatible schema first; backfill with stable IDs and source hashes, quarantine failures, reconcile counts and only then cut over. Restart uses command status and durable cursors. Unknown remote effects reconcile before retry; irreversible outcomes require forward recovery, not history deletion.",
